hich is a safer experience for you. <br><br><b>[Instant Message Chatting]</b><br>(1)You can have instant chatting with others in BuzzCast. Follow the people you are interested in with one click. Send a greeting to catch his/her eye, then get to know each other!<br>(2) Users can send and receive texts, photos, emojis, videos, and voice messages. Choose which way you like best.<br><br><b>[Nearby Moments]</b><br>(1)You can easily discover people nearby and have the opportunity to start an offline friendship.<br>(2)Capture important moments in your day and engage with other users.<br>(3)Get closer to the daily life of Internet celebrities.<br><br><b>[Creative Short Videos]</b><br>(1)Post 15 seconds short videos to the people who really focus on you, and never miss your favorite video stars by following them!<br>(2)We provide easy-to-use editing tools such as free and cool special effects, various stickers, popular music etc. Get ready to be famous if your video is on the trending!<br>(3)One click at the bullet screen, which helps you to enjoy real-time funny and cool comments.<br>(4)With the various contents from global &amp; local, you can not only discover the beauty around you, but also get real-time information around the world.<br><br><b>BuzzCast enables you to meet amazing people who are more in tune with you.</b><br><br>Contact and follow us: <br>Twitter: https://twitter.com/BuzzCastAPP<br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/buzzcastofficial<br>Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/buzzcast_official/<br>YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCkOgHgv-LeRCbEM8l0W25xA<br>Website: https://www.buzzcast.info/<br>Email: support@buzzcast.info",
